{"title":"RandomPage","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/6/bf6431872607653bc3a3348ff473621c3da4b3b9.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] import graph; size(200);  real f(real x) {return 70*x^2-98.3;}; real g1(real x) {return sqrt(4*4-x*x);}; real g2(real x) {return -sqrt(4*4-x*x);}; real g3(real x) {return -sqrt(2.7^2-x*x);}; draw(graph(f,-1.2,-1.185),black); draw(graph(f,1.185,1.2),black); draw(graph(g1,-4,4),black); draw(graph(g2,-4,4),black); draw(graph(g3,-2.3,2.3),black); [/asy]\" width=\"335\" height=\"335\" />\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017224451\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.001 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.001 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 505/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:21081:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017224451 and revision id 151186. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}